graph TD
    subgraph ClientConnections["Client Connections"]
        C1[Client 1]
        C2[Client 2]
        C3[Client 3]
    end

    subgraph IOWorkers["Multi-threaded I/O Workers (Redis 6: I/O offload, Redis 8: revised I/O threading)"]
        IO1[I/O Thread 1<br/>Read/Write Socket]
        IO2[I/O Thread 2<br/>Read/Write Socket]
        IO3[I/O Thread 3<br/>Read/Write Socket]
    end

    subgraph EventLoop["Main Event Loop (Single Threaded)"]
        Parser[Command Parser]
        Executor[Command Executor<br/>O1/OLogN Execution]
        Responder[Response Builder]
    end

    C1 <-->|Network| IO1
    C2 <-->|Network| IO2
    C3 <-->|Network| IO3

    IO1 -->|Parsed Request| Executor
    IO2 -->|Parsed Request| Executor
    IO3 -->|Parsed Request| Executor

    Executor -->|Response Data| IO1
    Executor -->|Response Data| IO2
    Executor -->|Response Data| IO3
